// Export real Entra ID sign-ins from Log Analytics (the workspace from Project 2) for notebook 02.
// Run in Log Analytics → Logs, then Export → CSV (all columns). Save as entra_signins_export.csv
// and upload it to the raw volume. READ-ONLY.
// Keep this file OUT of the repo and out of Tableau Public: it contains real usernames and IP addresses.
SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| project TimeGenerated, CorrelationId, UserPrincipalName, AppDisplayName, ClientAppUsed, IPAddress,
          City = tostring(LocationDetails.city), CountryOrRegion = tostring(LocationDetails.countryOrRegion),
          ResultType, AuthenticationRequirement, RiskLevelDuringSignIn, ConditionalAccessStatus
| order by TimeGenerated asc
